{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Do they run?</b> — Horsemen on rock." "<b>If one plows</b> — The one plowing rock with oxen. The meaning: for you change the natural order." "<b>For you have turned</b> — Justice, which is sweet to the weak, is in it with a vav or with an alef."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:25.629192037Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}